    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "team_0100_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "04928882C7D55B83",
      "text": "I know what I need to do... And I know what my\\nfinal decision will be...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "team_0100_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "04928782C7D559D0",
      "text": "For that, I can’t thank you enough. Take care in\\nthat base, M[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0305)]asteriss [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\c\\n...Ah. Sorry for getting all polite there. Don’t\\nknow what came over me.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
